# Build context of the Docker images (docker/docker-compose.yml): the whole
# repository, which they COPY. Exclude only what git doesn't track (mirror
# .gitignore): the image records `git diff HEAD` of its copy, so excluding a
# tracked file would make every container report the checkout as changed.

# Recorded rosbags (GBs): mounted from the host at runtime instead.
uwb_localization/bags/*
!uwb_localization/bags/README.md

plots/
**/*.pyc
